---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaBand from '../../components/CtaBand.astro';
import PageHead from '../../components/PageHead.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Cars911 — the UAE's car service aggregator"
  description="Cars911 connects UAE car owners with verified garages: one request, multiple quotes, honest comparisons. Trust. Choose. Cruise."
>
  <PageHead trail={[['/about/', 'About']]} title="About Cars911">
    Getting a car fixed in the UAE means choosing between a dealer you can't argue with and a
    street of garages you can't tell apart. Cars911 exists to fix that choice.
  </PageHead>

  <div class="spine-narrow pt-14 pb-20">
    <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-graphite">
      We verify garages before they can quote, put their prices, warranties and reviews side by
      side, and let the work go to whoever earns it. Owners save money; good garages win jobs on
      merit. <strong class="text-white">{SITE.tagline}</strong> isn't a slogan so much as the
      product itself: trust the network, choose your garage, get back on the road.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 title-sm">What we check before a garage joins</h2>
    <ul class="mt-5 border-t border-rule">
      {[
        'Valid trade licence and insurance',
        'Facility and equipment inspection',
        'Workmanship spot checks on completed jobs',
        'Customer history and complaint record',
        'Written warranty terms',
      ].map((item) => (
        <li class="border-b border-rule py-3">{item}</li>
      ))}
    </ul>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/about/how-it-works/" class="btn btn-primary">See how it works</a>
      <a href="/about/contact/" class="btn btn-quiet">Contact us</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <CtaBand heading="Trust. Choose. Cruise.">See how it works with a real request of your own.</CtaBand>
</BaseLayout>
